<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 13 bln SKR T-bills on Jan 8.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 13 bln SKR T-bills on Jan 8.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office on Tuesday said it was to auction 13 billion crowns worth of Treasury bills on January 8.</p>
<p>The paper will mature on January 15.  </p>
<p>The office said dealers were invited to leave bids by 1000 GMT on January 7 at the latest. The lowest accepted bid volume is 100 million crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
